<header class="page-hero wrap cakes-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Custom Cakes by PureBakes</p><h1>Custom Cakes in Hyderabad, Designed Around Your Celebration</h1><p>From birthdays and anniversaries to engagements, weddings and baby showers, PureBakes creates made-to-order cakes designed around your celebration. Share your occasion, preferred style, flavours and reference images, and we'll help turn them into a cake made specifically for you.</p><div class="button-row"><button class="button button--primary" data-availability-open data-cta-location="cakes_hero">Check Availability</button><a class="button button--light" href="/gallery/">View Cake Gallery</a></div></header>

