<section class="section wrap cakes-copy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Personal by design</p><h2>Every Cake Starts With Your Celebration</h2></div><div><p>PureBakes custom cakes don't begin with a fixed catalogue. They begin with the person and the occasion.</p><p>You can send us a cake you already love, combine ideas from several references or simply tell us about the celebration. We can then discuss the colours, theme, flavour, size and finishing details that suit your requirement.</p><p>From a child's favourite character to an elegant anniversary cake or a design built around someone's profession or hobby, the goal is to create something personal rather than simply reproduce the same cake for every customer.</p></div></section>

<section class="section cakes-themes"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Explore themes</p><h2>Find a visual direction.</h2></div><p>Browse popular cake themes and discover details you can personalise for your celebration.</p></div><div class="hub-grid theme-card-grid">{% for item in themePages %}{% set themeImage = cakesThemeImages[item.key] %}<a class="theme-card" href="{{ item.url }}"><img src="{{ themeImage.image }}" width="600" height="760" alt="{{ themeImage.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><span>{{ item.count }} designs</span><h2>{{ item.h1 }}</h2><p>{{ item.intro }}</p></div></a>{% endfor %}<a href="/cakes/themes/"><span>Theme inspiration</span><h2>All featured themes</h2><p>Compare our featured cake themes in one place.</p></a><a href="/gallery/"><span>472 real cakes</span><h2>Full portfolio</h2><p>Search and filter the complete PureBakes gallery.</p></a></div><p class="cakes-theme-note">Don't see your theme here? These collections are only starting points. PureBakes creates cakes around many interests, characters, professions, hobbies, colours and celebration styles. Share your idea or reference when you enquire.</p></div></section>

<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Finishes and formats</p><h2>Explore Different Cake Styles</h2></div><p>Choose a direction that suits the person, occasion and kind of celebration you are planning.</p></div><div class="cakes-card-grid cakes-card-grid--styles">{% for style in cakesPage.styles %}<article><h3>{{ style.title }}</h3><p>{{ style.description }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>

<section class="section wrap cakes-flavours"><div class="cakes-copy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Inside matters too</p><h2>Choose a Flavour You'll Enjoy</h2></div><div><p>The design may be what everyone sees first, but the cake still needs to taste good. Depending on your order, PureBakes offers a range of familiar and celebration-friendly flavours.</p><ul>{% for flavour in cakesPage.flavours %}<li>{{ flavour }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><p>Available flavours can vary by cake and requirement. Share your preferences when you enquire and we'll discuss suitable options.</p></div></div></section>

