<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Simple and personal</p><h2>From Your Idea to Your Cake</h2></div><p>Three clear steps take the conversation from an initial idea to a confirmed order.</p></div><ol class="cakes-steps"><li><span>01</span><h3>Share Your Celebration</h3><p>Tell us the date, occasion, approximate size and the kind of cake you have in mind. Send reference images if you have them.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Discuss the Design</h3><p>We'll discuss the design direction, flavour, size and other details and confirm what can be created for your requirement.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Confirm Your Order</h3><p>Once the details and price are agreed, complete the required advance to confirm your booking.</p></li></ol></section>

