<section class="section wrap cakes-copy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Every age, every story</p><h2>From First Birthdays to Milestone Celebrations</h2></div><div><p>Cake ideas naturally change with the person and the occasion. A first birthday might call for a playful character or pastel theme, while children's cakes can be built around favourite games, sports or characters. Teen celebrations may lean towards hobbies and contemporary styles, while 18th, 21st, 30th, 40th, 50th and later milestones often suit more personal, elegant or memory-led designs.</p><p>Tell us who the cake is for and what they enjoy. That usually gives us a much better starting point than choosing from a generic catalogue.</p></div></section>

